<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-CATALONIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-CATALONIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>MONTMELO, Spain 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading practice times</p>
<p>on Friday for Sunday's Grand Prix of Catalonia after the first</p>
<p>qualifying session:</p>
<p> 1. Luca Cadalora (Honda) Italy	 1 minute 46.815 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Carlos Checa (Honda) Spain	  1:46.894</p>
